# Matoya, Archon Elder: "Whenever you scry or surveil, draw a card." Bot1 casts Matoya with Black Lotus, then Dreams of Laguna (surveil 1, then draw a card) with
# Mox Sapphire and Mox Jet. The surveil puts the top card, an Island, into the graveyard (CR 701.25) and triggers Matoya: Dreams draws a card
# and Matoya draws another, so the library goes 33 -> 32 (surveil) -> 31 -> 30 and the hand is 7 - 5 cast + 2 = 4.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Matoya, Archon Elder
Dreams of Laguna
Island
Island
Island x33

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x40

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Matoya, Archon Elder.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
